 "phrases": [
  {
   "text": "A hundred thousand soldiers are surrounding my house.",
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 2.833,
   "w0": 0,
   "w1": 7
  },
  {
   "text": "And honestly?",
   "start": 3.395,
   "end": 4.515,
   "w0": 8,
   "w1": 9
  },
  {
   "text": "I deserve it.",
   "start": 5.003,
   "end": 5.806,
   "w0": 10,
   "w1": 12
  },
  {
   "text": "It started with a job offer.",
   "start": 6.393,
   "end": 7.859,
   "w0": 13,
   "w1": 18
  },
  {
   "text": "From heaven.",
   "start": 8.203,
   "end": 8.836,
   "w0": 19,
   "w1": 20
  },
  {
   "text": "To me,",
   "start": 9.258,
   "end": 9.699,
   "w0": 21,
   "w1": 22
  },
  {
   "text": "the monkey who erased his own death.",
   "start": 9.699,
   "end": 11.908,
   "w0": 23,
   "w1": 29
  },
  {
   "text": "The Jade Emperor smiled.",
   "start": 12.451,
   "end": 13.948,
   "w0": 30,
   "w1": 33
  },
  {
   "text": "\"Welcome!",
   "start": 14.375,
   "end": 14.913,
   "w0": 34,
   "w1": 34
  },
  {
   "text": "You'll be...",
   "start": 15.242,
   "end": 15.79,
   "w0": 35,
   "w1": 36
  },
  {
   "text": "Keeper of the Heavenly Horses.\"",
   "start": 16.152,
   "end": 17.833,
   "w0": 37,
   "w1": 41
  },
  {
   "text": "I got a fancy hat.",
   "start": 18.356,
   "end": 19.458,
   "w0": 42,
   "w1": 46
  },
  {
   "text": "A fancy desk.",
   "start": 19.743,
   "end": 20.879,
   "w0": 47,
   "w1": 49
  },
  {
   "text": "A thousand horses.",
   "start": 20.879,
   "end": 22.299,
   "w0": 50,
   "w1": 52
  },
  {
   "text": "I was so proud.",
   "start": 22.688,
   "end": 23.828,
   "w0": 53,
   "w1": 56
  },
  {
   "text": "Then a guard laughed.",
   "start": 24.224,
   "end": 26.251,
   "w0": 57,
   "w1": 60
  },
  {
   "text": "\"That's the lowest job in heaven.",
   "start": 26.653,
   "end": 28.25,
   "w0": 61,
   "w1": 66
  },
  {
   "text": "You're a stable boy.\"",
   "start": 28.536,
   "end": 29.567,
   "w0": 67,
   "w1": 70
  },
  {
   "text": "Stable.",
   "start": 30.129,
   "end": 30.72,
   "w0": 71,
   "w1": 71
  },
  {
   "text": "Boy.",
   "start": 31.285,
   "end": 31.643,
   "w0": 72,
   "w1": 72
  },
  {
   "text": "I kicked over the desk,",
   "start": 32.269,
   "end": 33.923,
   "w0": 73,
   "w1": 77
  },
  {
   "text": "flew home,",
   "start": 33.923,
   "end": 34.396,
   "w0": 78,
   "w1": 79
  },
  {
   "text": "and painted a giant flag:",
   "start": 34.396,
   "end": 35.815,
   "w0": 80,
   "w1": 84
  },
  {
   "text": "\"Great Sage,",
   "start": 36.123,
   "end": 36.67,
   "w0": 85,
   "w1": 86
  },
  {
   "text": "Equal to Heaven.\"",
   "start": 36.67,
   "end": 38.037,
   "w0": 87,
   "w1": 89
  },
  {
   "text": "Heaven sent an army.",
   "start": 38.522,
   "end": 39.527,
   "w0": 90,
   "w1": 93
  },
  {
   "text": "I sent them back...",
   "start": 39.931,
   "end": 40.856,
   "w0": 94,
   "w1": 97
  },
  {
   "text": "upside down.",
   "start": 41.122,
   "end": 41.937,
   "w0": 98,
   "w1": 99
  },
  {
   "text": "So the Emperor tried again.",
   "start": 42.437,
   "end": 43.726,
   "w0": 100,
   "w1": 104
  },
  {
   "text": "\"Fine!",
   "start": 44.126,
   "end": 44.538,
   "w0": 105,
   "w1": 105
  },
  {
   "text": "Guard my Peach Garden.\"",
   "start": 44.837,
   "end": 46.005,
   "w0": 106,
   "w1": 109
  },
  {
   "text": "These peaches grow once every three thousand years.",
   "start": 46.543,
   "end": 49.388,
   "w0": 110,
   "w1": 117
  },
  {
   "text": "Eat one...",
   "start": 49.866,
   "end": 50.294,
   "w0": 118,
   "w1": 119
  },
  {
   "text": "and you live forever.",
   "start": 50.683,
   "end": 51.657,
   "w0": 120,
   "w1": 123
  },
  {
   "text": "I ate one.",
   "start": 52.278,
   "end": 52.887,
   "w0": 124,
   "w1": 126
  },
  {
   "text": "Then another.",
   "start": 53.306,
   "end": 53.956,
   "w0": 127,
   "w1": 128
  },
  {
   "text": "Then...",
   "start": 54.297,
   "end": 54.725,
   "w0": 129,
   "w1": 129
  },
  {
   "text": "all of them.",
   "start": 55.081,
   "end": 55.639,
   "w0": 130,
   "w1": 132
  },
  {
   "text": "Then I found a party nobody invited me to.",
   "start": 56.037,
   "end": 58.772,
   "w0": 133,
   "w1": 141
  },
  {
   "text": "So I drank all their juice.",
   "start": 59.039,
   "end": 60.632,
   "w0": 142,
   "w1": 147
  },
  {
   "text": "Then I walked into Laozi's lab and ate his pills of immortality.",
   "start": 61.066,
   "end": 64.615,
   "w0": 148,
   "w1": 159
  },
  {
   "text": "Like candy.",
   "start": 64.939,
   "end": 65.621,
   "w0": 160,
   "w1": 161
  },
  {
   "text": "I woke up.",
   "start": 66.23,
   "end": 67.07,
   "w0": 162,
   "w1": 164
  },
  {
   "text": "Burped.",
   "start": 67.396,
   "end": 67.965,
   "w0": 165,
   "w1": 165
  },
  {
   "text": "And the sky turned gold.",
   "start": 68.473,
   "end": 70.106,
   "w0": 166,
   "w1": 170
  },
  {
   "text": "Which brings us back to the hundred thousand soldiers.",
   "start": 70.595,
   "end": 73.342,
   "w0": 171,
   "w1": 179
  },
  {
   "text": "Part four:",
   "start": 73.761,
   "end": 74.377,
   "w0": 180,
   "w1": 181
  },
  {
   "text": "me versus all of heaven.",
   "start": 74.606,
   "end": 76.167,
   "w0": 182,
   "w1": 186
  },
  {
   "text": "Follow so you don't miss it.",
   "start": 76.517,
   "end": 77.612,
   "w0": 187,
   "w1": 192
  }
 ]
